{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1306.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"b5c8c50cc765e23f1794b23d81c1053568b7a93e39f5432a76e5cb1ef17bd45e","ja":"育の選んだ人","zh":"育选的人","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1306.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"f69d204e9e231e5b6fdd79ec9275f23a14b86bdb1bc4654748073ccaeb6a511b","ja":"本当にモノマネでお芝居が上手になれるの？","zh":"模仿真的能让演技变好吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1306.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"3ee113d054e815222975ad91b4f7053c257d6be18cf49627e56c43fe41f2aeb8","ja":"モノマネって、その人のことをよーく見て、\nなりきることが大切でしょ？","zh":"模仿别人，就是要好好观察对方，\n然后全身心投入去扮演，对吧？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1306.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"a3b383d9fce510857d359e5abe580fc7f34659dd7f98183b386414c32d743da3","ja":"そうやって、いろんな性格の人になりきることが、\n役作りの練習になるんだよ。","zh":"像那样彻底融入各种不同性格的人物，\n就是在为塑造角色做练习哦。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1306.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"1822d0a6e2bd6ecafc00b0f6accad57d3d38e7798ce67b141c28599bbe206bfe","ja":"そっか～！　……でも、\n誰のモノマネをすればいいのかな……？","zh":"这样啊～！……不过，\n该去模仿谁才好呢……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1306.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"4ad549f9ef25b8d054ec6f8cb72d60b2373afb89390c8db04454a3b102f589b7","ja":"最初は、よく会う人からやってみるといいと思うよ。\nその人のこと、よく分かってると思うから。","zh":"我觉得一开始最好先从经常见面的人试起。\n因为这样的人你应该会很了解。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1306.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"ef064b0c4444f02a375c1417268ede225bfc37f59216eb1c199ee4072bd927b3","ja":"あっ、それならできるかも！　それじゃあ、\nやってみるから見ててね。えーっと……。","zh":"啊，那我说不定可以！那么，\n我试着做做看，你看好了哦。唔……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1306.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"3c9b8e28e5b79826a88ca0a00951ff53b6c8b71fd0a6c603d56266e719e63666","ja":"「この衣装、育とおそろいなんだね……。\nべ、べつに嫌じゃないよ……えへへっ♪」","zh":"「这套服装，和育是一样的呢……。\n又、又不是讨厌这样啦……诶嘿嘿♪」","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1306.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"8476458cfdd2bb404aa6e09444ac6a79093e0b1b21a0a5468b10fcafe039c587","ja":"えへへ、どうかな？","zh":"嘿嘿，怎么样呀？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1306.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"f0858014a525bf1ae9141ffbb7f7a5567d374cbf755d4afa349d3457dbef8fef","ja":"どうって……今の、桃子のモノマネだよね？\nどうして桃子なの？","zh":"怎么了……刚才那个，是在模仿桃子吧？\n为什么是桃子啊？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1306.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"3cd51861cc952290d37894c3560090ea4a950f94c8d7d524c911bb4216edb098","ja":"だって、よく会って、\nよく分かってる人がいいんだよね？","zh":"毕竟，还是常见面、\n互相很了解的人比较好吧？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1306.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"533e62e8c885d542b4dde9c2bf08b2c1fa1268bff5878f1eb17c0b7f7e78a0e8","ja":"それなら、桃子ちゃんがピッタリでしょ？","zh":"要是那样的话，桃子不是很合适吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1306.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"fef10514f4f0903c6274304263f1f68871ba737097418947d223535ff2d0263f","ja":"そ、そうかもしれないけど……。","zh":"也、也许是那样没错，但是……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1306.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"84cb142d1efad1ebab552fc3aad728307cdc21840ad0d66aeab333aa1ee1d471","ja":"……どうしたの、桃子ちゃん。赤くなってるよ？","zh":"……怎么了吗，桃子？脸都变红了哦？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1306.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"acc98384e52d04739c61ad10b9eb9e4a299ed630c23d530ac299c14d5a59b69a","ja":"な、なんでもない！　それより、自分のモノマネは\n似てるか分かんないから、別の人のをやってみて。","zh":"没、没什么！比起那个，我不知道模仿自己\n到底像不像，你还是去模仿别人吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1306.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"cae514177ff776fe0f193b74a3554c51cdf2cd44c564253dc9938f75d10e70cb","ja":"そっかぁ、それじゃあ……。","zh":"这样啊，那……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:50:11+00:00"}
